  and returns the same TaskCallback on rejection. Queue-owned vectors use fallible reservations;
  a five-point AllocationGate tests bounded construction rollback. This is safe deterministic
  gate injection, not a claim of deterministic operating-system OOM injection. Arc control-block
  allocation and Rust runtime internals remain governed by the standard allocator.
